Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:54.39,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.39,0:22:57.68,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.03,0:22:59.68,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I can't continue it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.13,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon, Rin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.76,0:23:05.03,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now I'm training for the sports meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:08.40,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I got much better at dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.97,0:23:12.10,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, or the time after that, I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:14.75,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "Letter".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.52,0:23:18.94,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.90,0:00:53.16,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.16,0:00:56.58,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:00:56.58,0:00:58.28,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:00:58.28,0:01:01.90,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
