Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.94,0:01:41.16,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.16,0:01:44.47,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
