Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.04,0:02:02.31,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.90,0:00:53.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.16,0:00:56.58,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:56.58,0:00:58.28,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:58.28,0:01:01.90,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.90,0:01:05.15,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:05.15,0:01:08.55,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:08.55,0:01:14.10,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:14.60,0:01:20.36,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:21.47,0:01:24.70,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:24.91,0:01:27.50,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.61,0:01:31.05,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:31.05,0:01:34.18,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.57,0:01:37.94,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.94,0:01:41.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.16,0:01:44.47,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.83,0:01:51.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:51.16,0:01:54.60,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.04,0:02:02.31,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:50.95,0:20:55.44,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 4,0:20:56.11,0:20:58.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.37,0:21:05.93,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.93,0:21:10.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.66,0:21:15.88,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.90,0:21:20.96,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 4,0:21:20.96,0:21:25.04,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.63,0:21:30.91,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 4,0:21:31.27,0:21:35.48,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.12,0:21:41.79,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.79,0:21:45.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.61,0:21:51.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
