Dialogue: 4,0:21:56.95,0:22:05.49,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 4,0:20:50.95,0:20:55.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:56.11,0:20:58.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.37,0:21:05.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.93,0:21:10.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.66,0:21:15.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.90,0:21:20.96,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:20.96,0:21:25.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.63,0:21:30.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:31.27,0:21:35.48,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.12,0:21:41.79,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.79,0:21:45.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.61,0:21:51.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:52.26,0:21:56.43,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:56.95,0:22:05.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:01.18,0:00:03.94,Main Dialog,TV Voice,0000,0000,0000,,If you're Type B, you need to take care.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.60,0:00:08.15,Main Dialog,TV Voice,0000,0000,0000,,If you continue to let it be, it could become a serious,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.15,0:00:09.94,Main Dialog,TV Voice,0000,0000,0000,,even life-threatening, situation.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.94,0:00:10.82,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Turn it off!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:10.82,0:00:14.28,Main Dialog,TV Voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}But this program will reveal the solution in one fell swoop!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.15,0:00:13.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This TV is sick!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:16.45,0:00:19.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's really nothing to be scared about...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How about taking a bath?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.79,0:00:26.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Am I gonna die too?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:26.92,0:00:27.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about? You're only 6 years old!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.97,0:00:39.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.78,0:02:15.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.03,0:02:26.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't decide on the next nursery school soon, I'll be in trouble!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.95,0:02:30.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard that smart people enter huge companies
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,that have a day care center on the premises.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.79,0:02:36.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But what country are we talking about here?!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.55,0:02:43.60,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:43.60,0:02:44.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.89,0:02:49.35,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, did you get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:49.35,0:02:50.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.19,0:02:52.23,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,You're going home early all the time these days...
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.23,0:02:54.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not that.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.32,0:02:57.03,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,You always used to take the last train, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.03,0:03:00.99,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,And last year, sales went through the roof because of you,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.99,0:03:02.07,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,but at this rate...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.07,0:03:06.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Those aren't figures that can be made through just enthusiasm or tenacity.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.37,0:03:08.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I was lucky.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.87,0:03:10.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,After all, my name's Daikichi...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.87,0:03:12.33,Main Dialog,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Note: Daikichi means "excellent luck".
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.33,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.79,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.67,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take that.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.76,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.76,0:03:20.05,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to the 4th floor, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:20.05,0:03:22.43,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. You guys doing well, as always?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.43,0:03:24.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not this year.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, this guy was just putting the pressure on me.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look how my hairline's receding.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.77,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,After you've achieved results \Nonce, it's tough, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.40,0:03:37.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Gotou-san, do you really have a child?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:37.48,0:03:39.86,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Do you doubt me just because I'm short?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.86,0:03:43.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, you're just so thin, I can't imagine where you stored the baby...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.24,0:03:45.70,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I can't remember anymore, either.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:46.74,0:03:48.33,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's two already.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.08,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. Just put them down here.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.71,0:03:53.00,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.00,0:03:54.88,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I can manage.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.88,0:03:55.67,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.67,0:03:57.71,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.55,0:04:01.97,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,She's as powerful as ever, y'know?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:02.34,0:04:05.47,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,If only Gotou-san had stayed in sales...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.47,0:04:09.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's worked here years longer than me,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.27,0:04:12.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but after getting pregnant, \Nshe requested a demotion,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.52,0:04:14.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so she could go home at a set time.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.44,0:04:18.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone in the company \Nwas talking about her...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.07,0:04:24.91,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going \Nto take care of her?!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No time frame has really been agreed on...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.16,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.04,0:04:32.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's been wetting the bed these days.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:32.66,0:04:35.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And I can tell that it really embarrasses her.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.75,0:04:38.25,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's an emotional thing.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.25,0:04:41.96,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,But you know, even though children sweat a surprising amount,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.26,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,they don't as much in the fall and winter, as you'd expect.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.26,0:04:46.18,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,That's why the number of times they pee increases.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:46.89,0:04:48.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I always used to be told,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:48.85,0:04:50.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Pee before going to bed."
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.85,0:04:55.35,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother must've had her reasons.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd ask her if I could...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But mothers are important, aren't they?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.69,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,If you're any kind of man, don't give up!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:03.69,0:05:04.61,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.11,0:05:07.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you play today?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.91,0:05:13.45,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I read picture books... and had a staring contest...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.96,0:05:17.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was it fun?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that for?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.88,0:05:24.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'm gonna make dinner right away.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.18,0:05:31.89,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The moon's deflated, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.32,0:05:45.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.03,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, how's it going?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine, sure...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:49.45,0:05:50.74,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not asking about you.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.49,0:05:53.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. She's good.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.37,0:05:57.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second, I thought you didn't want to be involved.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.50,0:05:59.38,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one that's taking care of her,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.67,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,so I can't help it.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:04.30,0:06:07.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna try to find some clues about Rin-chan's mom this weekend,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.22,0:06:08.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll be out your way.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.55,0:06:12.35,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I see... Then give me a call when you reach the station.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.68,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure you dress that girl warmly enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I'll invite Haruko, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It seems she's friendly with her girl.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.19,0:06:25.69,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We passed another car!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.19,0:06:28.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you're having a good time...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:28.57,0:06:29.36,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.45,0:06:35.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're here.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.45,0:06:38.71,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.29,0:06:41.46,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.04,0:06:42.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:47.88,0:06:53.26,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I don't have anything that would please a small child.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.26,0:06:57.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She likes old people stuff anyway. Right?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.60,0:07:00.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done already?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.14,0:07:00.89,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.89,0:07:03.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't come crying to me if you're hungry later.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:03.56,0:07:05.69,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm stuffed...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.78,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I couldn't finish.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:11.36,0:07:12.95,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.95,0:07:14.16,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.83,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,That was awful!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.58,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that annoying mother and child?!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.38,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:27.38,0:07:28.80,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,You seriously took custody of this girl?!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.51,0:07:31.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.55,0:07:36.60,Main Dialog,Announcer,0000,0000,0000,,And now the weather.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:36.60,0:07:40.10,Main Dialog,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,It's sunny and warm all over the country today.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.14,Main Dialog,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Temperatures in all regions are about
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.31,Main Dialog,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}two degrees higher than average for this time of year,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.31,0:07:45.90,Main Dialog,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}making for pleasant weather everywhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just going to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.90,0:07:48.28,Main Dialog,Weathergirl,0000,0000,0000,,And now let's look at the forecast for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.57,0:07:54.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I need to use the toilet!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.58,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go with you sitting there!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.25,0:08:08.30,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Is she always like that?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.76,0:08:13.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's a lot more talkative at home.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:14.22,0:08:17.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She even had fun on the train, \Nacting like she was on a trip.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.26,0:08:22.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But when we got here, the people waiting were the ones who were in a bad mood at the funeral.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.31,0:08:26.44,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you accusing us of?!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.44,0:08:32.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Dope. If adults are in a bad mood, kids think they're the ones the adults are mad at.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.57,0:08:35.91,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You're right...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.45,0:08:39.03,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It may have been that way for you kids, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.03,0:08:43.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See?! Insensitive as you are, you were the same way!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.46,0:08:46.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And Rin's smarter than you ever were!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:46.00,0:08:46.75,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, old man!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.47,0:08:58.72,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you like cat's cradle, don't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.64,0:09:02.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, at least answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.77,0:09:04.52,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.19,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give this one to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.99,0:09:14.28,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.53,0:09:18.74,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Watch Aunty do it first, okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.74,0:09:21.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Aunty"? You mean "Grandma," don't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.95,0:09:25.66,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're not old enough to be my grandma!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.66,0:09:28.29,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,My! What a good girl!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.29,0:09:31.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's because her standard for old age is way too high!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.01,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go first, so watch me!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:36.34,0:09:38.84,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Did I do it wrong?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.64,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.35,0:09:46.31,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This? A 4-step ladder.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.85,0:09:47.64,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,My!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.56,0:09:51.61,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A 2-step ladder.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.73,0:09:53.57,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,An airplane.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.19,0:09:55.03,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A slide.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:55.69,0:09:56.49,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A diamond!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.49,0:09:59.41,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.07,0:10:02.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's easy to do it with this yarn.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:03.41,0:10:04.83,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make this?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.83,0:10:07.75,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I knitted it from thin wool.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.71,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Doing that makes it the perfect weight,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.71,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,more than just making loops with woolen yarn.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.71,0:10:15.17,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I know! Since she's good with her hands, I bet she can do beanbags, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:17.72,0:10:20.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You hook it around your little finger like this...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.64,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.64,0:10:22.68,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's it!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.85,0:10:30.27,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, buckle my shoe. Three, \Nfour, knock at the door...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.27,0:10:32.19,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?! What the heck is going on here?!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"What is this?!" Isn't this what you wanted?!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.32,0:10:37.32,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.32,0:10:38.11,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:38.11,0:10:39.74,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe Haruko-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.57,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.53,0:10:44.58,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,These are pretty! What do you call them?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.58,0:10:45.66,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're beanbags.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for coming today.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.25,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You do it like this?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.29,0:10:50.42,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Like this?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.42,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.42,0:10:53.42,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Like this. And you sing \Na song as you do it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.42,0:10:54.13,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really impressed that you can \Njuggle working and raising a child.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.92,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}It's hard!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:54.96,0:10:58.30,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,My husband doesn't help \Nin that regard at all.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.92,0:10:57.84,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Aunty taught me how to do it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:57.84,0:10:58.76,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Who's your aunt?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:58.76,0:11:00.30,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Daikichi's mom.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:58.76,0:11:00.59,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to Grandpa's house now?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.30,0:11:02.97,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}That's not Aunty, that's Grandma!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.59,0:11:05.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I thought maybe I could \Nfind a clue to Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:04.68,0:11:06.06,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Isn't this a pretty string?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.22,0:11:06.06,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That makes sense...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.06,0:11:07.98,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}It's really easy to use.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.02,0:11:09.89,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After all, I think a mother is important.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.98,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Maybe I can do it good, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.98,0:11:11.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Go like this, then this...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:12.15,0:11:13.02,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.78,0:12:03.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Strange...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.82,0:12:06.58,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, you should've at least written a will.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you worried about Rin?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A modem?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.09,0:12:25.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.18,0:12:29.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's with that hair?!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.85,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She did it like Reina-chan's!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it, those clothes too...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,These are Kazumi's!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:37.56,0:12:39.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah? Kazumi?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.23,0:12:43.74,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! I told you she can't wear old, out-of-style clothes like these!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.36,0:12:46.87,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,See! They really do suit her!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.87,0:12:50.91,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess they're fine.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.41,0:12:55.42,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Since she has the body type of a modern child, that in itself makes the outfit modern, you know.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.63,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}This brings back memories.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.08,0:12:57.58,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,So how was Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.63,0:13:00.09,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}These were from when you were 4, Kazumi.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.54,0:13:00.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't find a single clue.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.96,0:13:01.88,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.26,0:13:06.26,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, even so, we shouldn't impatiently ask Rin-chan about this and that.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.39,0:13:10.14,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,You're doing your best.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.60,0:13:13.73,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,We may have never told you this...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.73,0:13:16.73,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,After you were born, Mom worked.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.69,0:13:20.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She hasn't been a housewife the whole time...?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:21.44,0:13:23.40,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,When she was pregnant with Kazumi,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.99,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,she overdid it and had to be hospitalized for a while.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.74,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,When she returned to work,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.74,0:13:30.45,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Mom found there wasn't a place for her anymore.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.66,0:13:34.25,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,She was terribly depressed.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.62,0:13:37.33,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,And Kazumi was so tiny when she was born...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.33,0:13:42.80,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Mom often took off work and came home early for you kids.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.63,0:13:45.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And what about Kazumi?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.30,0:13:49.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She made raising Kazumi her first priority,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.34,0:13:52.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so she ended up as you can see, arrogant and bossy!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:56.23,0:13:59.02,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,How are you on time? Do you want Dad to drop you off?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.02,0:14:01.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, we'll still make it if we walk.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.91,0:14:10.41,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we come back again?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:13.45,0:14:15.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She says, "Can we come back again?"
Dialogue: 4,0:14:19.96,0:14:23.67,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Aunty will be here waiting for you, so come back anytime.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.55,0:14:25.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.89,0:14:34.14,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.14,0:14:36.52,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with wanting a grandchild?!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.14,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'd take care of the baby...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:38.14,0:14:41.02,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't work and raise a child at the same time!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.02,0:14:43.27,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,For a woman, that's a huge loss!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:43.27,0:14:46.57,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I still want to wear a swimsuit and go out drinking...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:50.86,0:14:53.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin, did Grandpa have a computer?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:54.33,0:14:56.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what a computer is?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.12,0:14:56.79,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did Grandpa use it?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.25,0:15:01.37,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The maid used it.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.37,0:15:03.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He had a maid?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.59,0:15:05.67,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The maid's name was Masako-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:09.01,0:15:12.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What was she like?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.47,0:15:16.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember that much...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.57,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I hate Masako-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.08,0:15:39.96,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She hated me and was always angry.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.96,0:15:41.21,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I was scared of her...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.58,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I forgot about her.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:46.80,0:15:47.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.05,0:15:52.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little late to be saying this,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:52.68,0:15:55.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but it's tough to work full-time and raise a kid, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.72,0:15:57.93,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You've got that right.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.93,0:15:59.18,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,There's never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.39,0:16:04.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um, have you ever thought that you were sacrificing yourself
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.19,0:16:07.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,by having a child, Gotou-san?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.36,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Are you referring to my change in position?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:09.36,0:16:12.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I know this is being rude, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:12.53,0:16:16.37,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm, at the time, I thought that was the best choice,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:16.37,0:16:18.33,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,and it turned out all right, so I have no problem with it.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:22.62,0:16:25.92,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,But even if it was a sacrifice for me,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:25.92,0:16:28.17,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:28.17,0:16:30.38,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Because words have a strong power, see?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.05,0:16:33.01,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,"The spirit of language," is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:33.55,0:16:35.34,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Is that too abstract?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:35.34,0:16:36.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:36.43,0:16:38.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I understand exactly what you mean!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:39.47,0:16:42.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me more about kids again sometime.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:43.94,0:16:46.81,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-kun, your child is older than mine, isn't she?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:46.81,0:16:49.82,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to teach {\i1}me{\i0}, Senpai!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:17.05,0:17:18.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.05,0:17:19.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can wake me up.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:19.93,0:17:21.89,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But, it's sweat!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:21.89,0:17:24.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whether it's sweat or whatever, it's fine.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.10,0:17:29.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have a bad dream?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:32.19,0:17:34.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's it like to die?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:35.90,0:17:38.82,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, are you gonna die before me?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:41.08,0:17:43.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sadness about Grandpa's death...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.75,0:17:45.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Anxiety over what would happen if I died...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:47.21,0:17:49.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fear of her own death...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:49.75,0:17:54.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She isn't able to sort these out one by one, so she's all mixed up.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.76,0:17:59.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, everything will be fine until you're a young lady.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:01.26,0:18:03.27,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,When will I be a young lady?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:04.14,0:18:07.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, everything will be fine until you're a middle-aged lady.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:07.73,0:18:10.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Until then, I am {\i1}not{\i0} gonna die!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Count on it!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:15.40,0:18:16.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:17.24,0:18:19.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And don't worry about wetting the bed either.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.53,0:18:21.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine as long as you go to the toilet before bedtime.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:21.91,0:18:23.58,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The toilet is scary!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:23.58,0:18:25.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go with you at night.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.79,0:18:27.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And if you still have an accident after that,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:28.37,0:18:29.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,all we have to do is change your pajamas.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:31.29,0:18:32.84,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will you be mad?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:33.30,0:18:37.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing to be mad about, and it's nothing to be laughed at.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:38.88,0:18:39.63,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:42.35,0:18:44.85,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you want to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:45.27,0:18:47.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry this is so sudden, Hidaka-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.48,0:18:51.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um... This is out of the blue,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:51.02,0:18:53.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but please transfer me to a section that doesn't require working overtime!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:54.73,0:18:58.03,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,What? Kawachi... Are you serious about this?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Totally serious!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:01.49,0:19:04.41,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So that's what's new in your life...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:04.41,0:19:06.95,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Personally, I think it's a real shame...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:06.95,0:19:09.58,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,But I've got a kid, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:09.58,0:19:13.08,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, I'll try to convince the section chief.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:13.08,0:19:16.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. But I really appreciate your help.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.26,0:19:19.72,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,You do know the people under you will make a fuss.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.26,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I can't understand it!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:22.26,0:19:24.22,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Why did it have to be you, Kawachi-san?!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.35,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you ask another relative?!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:26.35,0:19:29.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't tell him that I insisted on taking her in myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:29.14,0:19:33.19,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,And aren't there nursery schools that'll let kids stay until late at night?!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:33.19,0:19:36.23,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to work for anyone but you, Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:37.32,0:19:39.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Certainly, this is sudden...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:40.20,0:19:43.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But higher-ups often transfer people suddenly.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:43.24,0:19:44.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make a fuss!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:48.66,0:19:50.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But... I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:52.87,0:19:56.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even without me, my section will eventually settle down.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And they should be able to shuffle people around.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:57.55,0:19:59.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If not, there's something wrong with the organization.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:59.92,0:20:02.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't let Rin go on like this!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:02.47,0:20:03.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.89,0:20:05.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My line of thinking isn't wrong...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:05.97,0:20:06.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:08.01,0:20:08.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:09.77,0:20:11.35,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you finish?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:12.06,0:20:13.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You want this much rice?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:13.35,0:20:14.35,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's perfect!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:14.90,0:20:18.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Towel, box lunch, slippers, toothbrush, cup...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:18.69,0:20:19.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,With your name on everything!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:19.78,0:20:20.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Futon?!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:20.78,0:20:22.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's only for the babies...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:22.65,0:20:23.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:27.74,0:20:29.99,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:32.87,0:20:35.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, I couldn't say "This isn't a sacrifice"
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.67,0:20:38.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,without it sounding like a lie...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.92,0:20:42.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But I hope I'll be able to think that way in a few years from now.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:14.68,0:22:19.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you have that same thing on your hand towel and lunch box...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:19.77,0:22:20.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.81,0:22:23.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Like a dog with huge ears...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.23,0:22:24.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a dog!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:25.99,0:22:27.74,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's Lop Ear!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.74,0:22:30.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Lop...? What's that?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:30.32,0:22:31.57,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A rabbit!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:31.57,0:22:34.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a little dog?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:34.24,0:22:35.33,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a rabbit!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:36.54,0:22:37.04,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.67,0:22:46.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's go pee.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:46.09,0:22:47.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I already went!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:48.09,0:22:48.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that right?
